  "title": "Baba Ghanoush",
  "description": "Baba ghanoush (or baba ganoush) is a smoky Middle Eastern roasted eggplant dip with garlic, tahini, and lemon that's easy to make for a delicious appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Tali"
  ],
